  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ret 308.12 Receipt Of Direct Payment. If a direct payment is escrowed pursuant to Ret 308.11(b), upon their meeting the eligibility requirements of Ret 308.11(a) the eligible employee shall receive such payment directly from the employer. If the eligible employee, however, terminates employment with the employer, prior to becoming eligible to receive the escrowed direct payment, the obligation of the employer to make such direct payment shall terminate.\n\nSource. #5324, eff 2-5-92 (from Ret 307.04), EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #7375, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7478, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7573, eff 10-10-01, EXPIRED: 10-10-09\n\nNew. #9562, eff 10-14-09, EXPIRED: 10-14-17\n\nNew. #12511, INTERIM, eff 4-11-18, EXPIRED: 10-8-18\n\nNew. #12707, eff 1-9-19",
